        <p><strong>Pension income is one of the most straightforward ways to meet Non-Lucrative Visa income requirements.</strong> If you receive a regular, reliable pension from the UK, US, or other countries, you may qualify without needing to demonstrate business income, employment, or complex investments. This guide walks you through everything you need to know.</p>
